WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.890 --> 00:00:02.450
- Yeah, I've never been
on this street before.

00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:03.850
I have no idea where we are.

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:10.570
I have a Shiba Inu named
Hadley and I love her,

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:12.360
and I take her on a walk every morning.

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:14.100
We kind of go to the same places

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:17.490
And today is a really beautiful
day outside in February.

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:19.320
It's like 60-something degrees.

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:21.840
I have a little extra time before work,

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:24.380
so I figured I'm going to let her walk me.

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:26.690
I'm just curious to
see where she takes me,

00:00:26.690 --> 00:00:28.460
if I learn something new about her.

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:31.300
Honestly I have no idea
where she'll take me.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:33.260
Before we do this, we got
to set up some ground rules.

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:35.150
One, you're gonna to be
in charge of where we go.

00:00:35.150 --> 00:00:38.290
But two, you will not be
allowed to step into traffic.

00:00:38.290 --> 00:00:40.320
I will not put you into
that unsafe situation.

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:41.750
Ready to go?
Kisses.

00:00:44.203 --> 00:00:45.370
And we're off.

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:50.220
Our first intersection,
gotta wait for these cars.

00:00:52.395 --> 00:00:53.228
Where we going now?

00:00:53.228 --> 00:00:54.900
She's taking us on our normal route.

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:56.310
Hadley are you confused?

00:00:58.590 --> 00:01:00.810
So this is maybe going to
teach me a lot patience,

00:01:00.810 --> 00:01:02.697
'cause I am just like why
are you sitting there?

00:01:02.697 --> 00:01:05.830
But she's walking now,
were going this way?

00:01:05.830 --> 00:01:09.488
So Hadley seems to want to
sit, do some people watching.

00:01:09.488 --> 00:01:10.855
It's really hot.

00:01:10.855 --> 00:01:14.900
Cute.
♪ You're so cute ♪

00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:15.733
She got up,

00:01:15.733 --> 00:01:17.560
but I don't know think she
knows where she wants to go.

00:01:17.560 --> 00:01:18.990
Nope, this way?

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:21.500
I think we're heading to a park,

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:23.150
We don't go to this park that often.

00:01:23.150 --> 00:01:26.300
At least not during the
week because it's kinda far.

00:01:29.182 --> 00:01:32.052
(upbeat pop music)

00:01:32.052 --> 00:01:34.050
We've been walking like an hour

00:01:34.050 --> 00:01:36.120
and normally our morning
walks are a half hour.

00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:37.778
I'm tired.

00:01:37.778 --> 00:01:39.537
Where are we Hadley?

00:01:39.537 --> 00:01:41.260
Did you take us to a park?

00:01:50.057 --> 00:01:52.668
Yeah, you so happy.

00:01:52.668 --> 00:01:54.720
Good girl.
Yeah.

00:01:55.750 --> 00:01:57.670
I'm just waiting while she takes a sit.

00:01:57.670 --> 00:01:59.360
It makes me kind of self reflective.

00:01:59.360 --> 00:02:02.330
She's making me stop while
she smells the roses,

00:02:02.330 --> 00:02:04.010
or in this case, dead grass.

00:02:04.010 --> 00:02:06.660
I'm going to just try to just
sit, and people watch with her

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:08.620
in this dirt pile.

00:02:08.620 --> 00:02:09.690
Now were moving.

00:02:09.690 --> 00:02:10.990
I'm just going to move my feet a little

00:02:10.990 --> 00:02:14.270
to just let her know,
I'm cool with leaving

00:02:14.270 --> 00:02:16.340
But like no pressure.
See now she's moving.

00:02:16.340 --> 00:02:18.630
I do feel closer to her.

00:02:18.630 --> 00:02:21.240
I feel like were listening
to each other more.

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:22.960
Now the real test is to see if

00:02:22.960 --> 00:02:24.910
she's going to be able to take me home.

00:02:27.262 --> 00:02:30.179
(upbeat pop music)

00:02:32.848 --> 00:02:33.790
I have no idea where we are.

00:02:33.790 --> 00:02:36.757
Hoping she knows a better way home

00:02:36.757 --> 00:02:38.390
and I don't know about it.

00:02:39.402 --> 00:02:40.263
All right.

00:02:40.263 --> 00:02:41.810
Hadley do you know where we are?

00:02:41.810 --> 00:02:45.000
I'm gonna try to not use
my google maps or anything

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:46.360
'cause I want to trust in the Shib.

00:02:46.360 --> 00:02:47.730
Might be really dumb.

00:02:48.928 --> 00:02:50.500
I have never been on this street before.

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:52.170
Would I recommend this at
this point in the journey?

00:02:52.170 --> 00:02:53.100
No.

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:55.850
We're back to the same street
corner that we came from.

00:02:57.320 --> 00:03:00.280
Maybe she is not taking us
home and I was just hopeful.

00:03:01.900 --> 00:03:04.110
Maybe she doesn't know how to get home.

00:03:04.110 --> 00:03:05.450
Probable, 'cause she's a dog.

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:07.650
Now I've been doing this for two hours.

00:03:07.650 --> 00:03:08.500
I'm not home yet.

00:03:12.985 --> 00:03:13.985
Hi.
Hi hi hi.

00:03:16.726 --> 00:03:18.140
I finally recognize the
street that were on.

00:03:18.140 --> 00:03:18.973
I think were going home.

00:03:18.973 --> 00:03:20.650
Am I proud of my impatience?
No.

00:03:21.510 --> 00:03:22.350
Its a red light.

00:03:23.940 --> 00:03:26.840
It's about the journey, not
the destination, right Hadley?

00:03:28.997 --> 00:03:32.140
I believe she could curse
but I'm inconclusive.

00:03:34.067 --> 00:03:36.740
Were doing it, were home.

00:03:36.740 --> 00:03:38.470
Oh my god, thank god.

00:03:38.470 --> 00:03:40.710
Right Had?
You ready to go in?

00:03:40.710 --> 00:03:42.720
So were back from our adventure.

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:44.610
It was two and a half hours.

00:03:44.610 --> 00:03:46.950
She listens to me more than I thought,

00:03:46.950 --> 00:03:49.450
and waits for my cues,
which is really good.

00:03:49.450 --> 00:03:52.120
Also I need to maybe stop brushing.

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:54.340
It was nice to kind of just
take a sit in the park,

00:03:54.340 --> 00:03:56.020
and people watch before work.

00:03:56.020 --> 00:03:57.490
We can learn a lot from dogs.

00:03:57.490 --> 00:03:59.020
I know I'm a crazy dog person,

00:03:59.020 --> 00:04:02.790
but like, look at this
face, how cute is she?

00:04:02.790 --> 00:04:04.180
Would you do it again?

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:07.040
I'm going to take that as a maybe.

